        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "e = \\frac{m_p + m_k}{m_k} y_B = \\frac{828}{180} \\cdot 0{,}0435 = 0{,}200\\ \\text{m}\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "odnosno\n",
        "\n",
